#guide The guide now rides on the review screen: steps in the left pane, one file's diff in the middle, arrows walk files in guide order.
#risk medium Changes how the review screen picks the file order and the left pane for every pull request that has a guide.
#gstep careful Turn the guide into ordered stops
#gwhy Everything else leans on this pure module, so read it first. A stop is one file of one step, and the same file under two steps is two stops.
#ghunk src/renderer/lib/lanternguide.ts
#gpseudo list each changed file of each step in step order
#gpseudo append the changed files no step names
#gpseudo find the stop of a file, keeping the current one if it still fits
#gpseudo mark the diff rows a step's line ranges cover
#gstep careful Show the step next to the diff
#gwhy The review pane gets the step note above the diff and marks the step's lines once the diff has drawn. The diff view now reports each fill so the marks are never lost.
#ghunk src/renderer/lib/lanternreview.ts
#ghunk src/renderer/lib/lanternguidenote.ts
